# Lab 4 — An exception handler: the checks of a finished handler
# (Run → Check, or python3 -m emips check docs/guide/labs/lab4_misaligned.asm)
check: output is "bad address 0x10010002"   (the message and BadVAddr, in hex)
check: exceptions == 1         (the address error, taken once: the lw was skipped)
check: $t1 == 0                (the lw that failed changed nothing)
